7
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:46,040
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,400
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:54,759
Ye.

10
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,399
Live a good life.

11
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,759
Live the way you want.

12
00:01:02,079 --> 00:01:04,000
Go. Now!

13
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:08,120
Grandma!

14
00:01:17,719 --> 00:01:18,599
Grandma!

15
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:22,120
That's enough, Lu Mingyu.

16
00:01:22,519 --> 00:01:23,400
Engagement's tomorrow.

17
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,040
Grandma!

18
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:33,719
Let's go.

19
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:35,760
Enough! Move!

20
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,959
Please... Open the door.

21
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:37,680
Come on!

22
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,000
Let's go!

23
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:56,800
=Quite The Girl=

24
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:57,080
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite the Girl.")

25
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:57,360
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

26
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,600
=Episode 8=

27
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,919
You hate being locked up.

28
00:02:14,759 --> 00:02:15,919
Why so quiet today?

29
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:18,919
Where's Grandma?

30
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:21,639
Dead.

31
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,280
Happy now?

32
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,719
You killed her.

33
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,039
You're so heartless.

34
00:02:36,319 --> 00:02:37,560
Didn't even shed a tear.

35
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,319
So much for your bond.

36
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,280
You don't look sad at all.

37
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,159
Do I have to cry in front of you?

38
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,840
Who do you think you are?

39
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,759
Lu Mingyu,
you and your mom are both trash.

40
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:56,960
She was a cheap actress.

41
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:58,599
You're just like her.

42
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,639
You've got gutter blood.

43
00:03:01,719 --> 00:03:02,639
Actress?

44
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:05,039
My mom was a national-level performer.

45
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:07,120
An inheritor
of intangible cultural heritage.

46
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,319
A leading opera actress!

47
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,199
Enough!

48
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,680
Cut the act.

49
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,400
Heaven knows what cheap tricks you used

50
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,599
to make Qin Lian marry you.

51
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:18,960
What did you say?

52
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,960
Drop the innocent act.

53
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:24,439
Isn't this what you

54
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:25,439
wanted all along?

55
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:27,639
Too bad.

56
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:30,879
Man plans, fate laughs.

57
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,120
Grandma died so suddenly.

58
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,520
No wedding during mourning.

59
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,759
So it's just an engagement.

60
00:03:42,919 --> 00:03:43,599
So...

61
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:45,240
Lu Mingyu.

62
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,639
You may not marry into

63
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:48,639
the Qin family.

64
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:50,719
Don't get your hopes up.

65
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:54,599
Grandma gave her life to clear my path.

66
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,800
She shouldn't have died.

67
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,759
It should be you demons.

68
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:01,479
Say that again.

69
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:02,680
I'll beat you to death.

70
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:08,680
Let go of me!

71
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,280
Are you crazy?

72
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,680
You wouldn't dare kill me.

73
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,719
Why wouldn't I?

74
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:22,720
Stop!

75
00:04:23,079 --> 00:04:23,720
Stop!

76
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:33,879
Lu Mingyu!

77
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:34,920
What are you doing?

78
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,639
You rabid dog!

79
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,720
I want you both

80
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,600
dead with Grandma!

81
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,160
You're insane.

82
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,360
If not for the engagement,

83
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,720
you'd be sorry!

84
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,800
Ming,

85
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,079
it's been so long.

86
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,240
Why haven't we heard

87
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:07,000
anything about Auntie Chen's daughter?

88
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:09,439
Could something else

89
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,199
be keeping you in Xizi City?

90
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:14,360
No, Mom.

91
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,040
I've been looking.

92
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,759
Find her soon.

93
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:20,199
I need time to plan your wedding.

94
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,160
Mom...

95
00:05:24,839 --> 00:05:26,879
I'm not your debt repayment plan.

96
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:28,319
Besides, I...

97
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,399
Besides what?

98
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:31,879
I have a girl I like.

99
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,319
Before you went to Xizi,

100
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:35,879
you said no one caught your eye.

101
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,079
It's only been a while.

102
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,240
Now you like someone?

103
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:39,720
I met her there.

104
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,399
I knew it.

105
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:43,040
You weren't really

106
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,800
looking for her daughter.

107
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,560
All right.

108
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,600
I'm sorry.

109
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:49,160
I'll look harder.

110
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:51,040
But promise me,

111
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,040
I won't marry her daughter.

112
00:05:53,279 --> 00:05:55,639
You brat. I'm not that tacky.

113
00:05:55,879 --> 00:05:58,279
Am I the type to force matches?

114
00:05:58,839 --> 00:05:59,879
Of course not.

115
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:02,680
Mom, I think...

116
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,120
You should stop worrying about her.

117
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,000
Start thinking about a welcome gift

118
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,160
for your future daughter-in-law.

119
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,040
That fast?

120
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:11,720
Tell me all about her.

121
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:13,279
What's she like?

122
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:14,480
I'll find a photo.

123
00:06:22,639 --> 00:06:24,000
(Qin-Lu union announced)
(Second daughter Lu Mingyu)

124
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,920
(engaged to Qin Lian, the eldest son.)

125
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,319
(Ceremony in three days.)

126
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,600
(A powerful match.)

127
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:31,439
(Lu Mingyu and Qin Lian are engaged.)

128
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:46,040
Impossible.

129
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,079
Mingyu.

130
00:06:51,879 --> 00:06:52,600
Just got word.

131
00:06:52,759 --> 00:06:54,720
Miss Lu is getting engaged.

132
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:56,720
And...

133
00:06:57,279 --> 00:06:58,120
Go on.

134
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:00,319
She seems to want this, too.

135
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,079
She just posted it

136
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,040
on her social feed.

137
00:07:03,519 --> 00:07:05,439
Word's already spreading.

138
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:14,200
(Lu Mingyu)

139
00:07:17,839 --> 00:07:19,399
She has another WeChat.

140
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,439
Yes.

141
00:07:20,759 --> 00:07:21,680
I just found out too.

142
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:23,040
She posted it here.

143
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:23,600
Here.

144
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:25,759
The screenshot.

145
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:29,600
(Lu Mingyu: Engagement announced.)

146
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,519
So I added her alt account.

147
00:07:33,759 --> 00:07:34,519
Probably.

148
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,240
She's used this one for years.

149
00:07:37,079 --> 00:07:37,879
Everyone in Xizi

150
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,519
