151
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,199
Great.

152
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:02,439
Lu Mingyu.

153
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:04,639
You...

154
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,560
You're really something.

155
00:08:20,959 --> 00:08:22,240
Miss Lu...

156
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,079
Tell the Lus to come.

157
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,480
Lu Mingyu, what do you want?

158
00:08:39,759 --> 00:08:40,480
Be smart!

159
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,639
I want to see Grandma.

160
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,720
She's dead!

161
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:44,519
The funeral?

162
00:08:46,159 --> 00:08:47,320
Buried quietly this morning.

163
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:48,799
Don't cause trouble.

164
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,879
I need to say goodbye.

165
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,960
After the engagement.

166
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:53,799
I'm going now!

167
00:08:53,799 --> 00:08:54,159
You...

168
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,000
Lu Lin!

169
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,039
Let her go.

170
00:09:06,799 --> 00:09:08,120
It's the last time anyway.

171
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:17,560
(Tao Yalan)

172
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:31,280
(Tao Yalan)

173
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,200
Grandma...

174
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:46,080
(Tao Yalan)

175
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:54,240
Did you push Grandma to kill herself?

176
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:05,919
Yes...

177
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:08,200
Or no?

178
00:10:11,519 --> 00:10:13,320
No idea what you mean.

179
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,559
Make it quick.

180
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:31,559
Mingyu.

181
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:33,080
The car's here.

182
00:10:33,159 --> 00:10:33,960
It's waiting outside.

183
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,320
Maybe take a breath first?

184
00:10:35,399 --> 00:10:36,399
You look like

185
00:10:36,399 --> 00:10:37,600
you're about to kill someone.

186
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:41,279
Mingyu.

187
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,559
(Lu Mingyu: Dare to crash the wedding?)

188
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:50,480
She's being forced.

189
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:51,799
Mingyu.

190
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:52,720
The key.

191
00:10:53,279 --> 00:10:53,679
Here!

192
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:56,320
Mingyu!

193
00:10:57,399 --> 00:10:59,759
We're gathered here today

194
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:01,039
to witness

195
00:11:01,039 --> 00:11:03,960
the union of Mr. Qin Lian

196
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:06,240
and Miss Lu Mingyu.

197
00:11:06,799 --> 00:11:08,519
Let's give the couple

198
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:10,200
a big round of applause!

199
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,159
Lu Mingyu.

200
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,399
Will you marry me?

201
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,000
I don't marry wimps.

202
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,440
♪Soft look hides the fire deep inside♪

203
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:42,400
♪Gentle smile never tells my fight♪

204
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,559
♪They think I'm weak, easy to control♪

205
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:46,039
Do you hear yourself?

206
00:11:46,879 --> 00:11:49,080
Without your family's money and power,

207
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:50,600
someone like you...

208
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:53,080
I wouldn't even give a second glance.

209
00:11:54,759 --> 00:11:57,240
Lu Mingyu, you dare mock me?

210
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:59,240
Don't push your luck.

211
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,960
This wedding isn't up to you.

212
00:12:02,559 --> 00:12:03,200
Go on.

213
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,879
Just a little misunderstanding.

214
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:07,279
Let's still wish them well...

215
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,120
Wait!

216
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:25,360
♪Wherever you go♪

217
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,280
♪Oh, you♪

218
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:30,200
♪Wherever you are♪

219
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:33,800
♪Wherever you go♪

220
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:38,360
♪Wherever you go♪

221
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:40,800
♪For you♪

222
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:43,600
♪Wherever you are♪

223
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:46,640
♪Wherever you go♪

224
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:51,640
♪Wherever you go♪

225
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,600
♪For you♪

226
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:57,360
♪Wherever you are♪

227
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,920
♪Wherever you go♪

228
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:32,280
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

229
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:38,760
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

230
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:46,440
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

231
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:52,600
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

232
00:13:55,120 --> 00:14:01,520
♪A love letter written in song♪

233
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:06,800
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

234
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:15,240
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

235
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:21,800
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

236
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:29,360
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

237
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:32,240
♪Close your eyes and count♪

238
